  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En studie som syftar till f&#xf6;rsoning i norra Kosovo. Detta genom att studera aktiviteter och samarbete bland gr&#xe4;sr&#xf6;tter i norra kosovo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Measures towards reconciliation in the North of Kosovo. By studying cooperation and activities on grass root level across ethnic borders in the north of Kosovo, Kipred intends to identify best practices and propose measures aiming towards reconciliation. A report including recommendations will be presented.</narrative>
  </description>
